# PART A: STANDARD LICENSE ($499)

## 1. Grant of Standard License

This Standard License grants you, the purchaser, a non-exclusive, non-transferable right to:

- Use the source code for ONE (1) personal or commercial project
- Modify the source code for your own use within the single project
- Deploy the application on your own servers or hosting platforms
- Use the platform to operate ONE (1) crypto faucet business
- Receive software updates for SIX (6) months from purchase date

## 2. Standard License Restrictions

Under the Standard License, you may NOT:

- Use the software for more than ONE (1) end product/project
- Remove, alter, or hide the "Powered by Crypto Faucet Platform" branding
- Use the software to create client projects or products for others
- Offer the software as a SaaS (Software as a Service) product
- Create a multi-tenant application serving multiple businesses
- Resell, redistribute, sublicense, or share the source code
- Claim the source code as your own original work
- Use the code to create competing products for sale
- Transfer the license to another person or entity

## 3. Standard License - Branding Requirements

The Standard License requires you to maintain visible attribution:

- Footer must display "Powered by Crypto Faucet Platform" or similar attribution
- Attribution link must be functional and visible to end users
- Attribution may be styled to match your site but cannot be hidden
- Minimum font size of 12px for attribution text

