# PART B: EXTENDED LICENSE ($999)

## 1. Grant of Extended License

This Extended License grants you, the purchaser, a non-exclusive, transferable right to:

- Use the source code for UNLIMITED personal or commercial projects
- Modify the source code without restrictions
- Deploy the application on unlimited servers or hosting platforms
