- Complete white-label rights with full branding removal
- Create and sell projects/products for clients using this software
- Offer the software as a SaaS (Software as a Service) product
- Create multi-tenant applications serving multiple businesses
- Receive LIFETIME software updates
- Priority email support for SIX (6) months from purchase date

## 2. Extended License Restrictions

Under the Extended License, you may NOT:

- Resell, redistribute, sublicense, or share the raw source code
- Sell the software itself as a product (you sell the END PRODUCT, not the code)
- Claim the original source code as your own creation
- Provide the source code to end users (only compiled/deployed versions)
- Use the code to create a directly competing marketplace product
- Transfer the Extended License itself to another developer/agency

## 3. Extended License - White-Label Rights

The Extended License includes full white-label rights:

- Remove all "Crypto Faucet Platform" branding
- Replace with your own branding, logos, and company name
- No attribution required in the final product
- Full customization of all user-facing text and imagery
- Create derivative brands for client projects

## 4. Extended License - Client Projects

For agency/freelancer use:

- You may create unlimited end products for clients
- Each client project is considered a separate end product
- Clients receive the deployed product, NOT the source code
- You remain the license holder for all client projects
- Clients may not modify, resell, or redistribute the underlying code

## 5. Extended License - SaaS Rights

For SaaS/Multi-Tenant deployments:

- Offer the platform as a hosted service to multiple customers
- Charge subscription fees to your customers
- Create tenant-specific customizations
- White-label the platform for each tenant if desired
- No per-tenant licensing fees to the original author

