### Anti-Adblock System ($2,000+ value)
- 2900+ lines of detection code
- 30+ detection methods
- Zero false positives architecture
- Cross-session tracking
- Server verification
- Bayesian probability scoring

### Offerwall Integrations (10 providers)
- CPAGrip, OGAds, Lootably, Torox
- Notik, AdGateMedia, OfferToro
- Wannads, BitLabs, Timewall
- Ready-to-use postback handlers

### Admin Dashboard
- Real-time analytics
- User management
- Fraud detection
- Withdrawal processing
- System settings
- Ad management

### Payment Integration
- FaucetPay support
- ExpressCrypto support
- Multi-currency (BTC, ETH, LTC, DOGE, USDT, etc.)

### Security Features
- Supabase authentication
- Row Level Security (RLS)
- CSRF protection
- Rate limiting
- Fraud scoring

### Documentation
- 12+ detailed guides
- Installation walkthrough
